        "name": "Quintin Smits",
        "email": "qd.smits@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-27T02:03:41Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): built-in ER collets, stack values and swap in the tool library window\n\nThe built-in component catalogue holds the metric ER collets of the\nholder library's ER table (ER11-ER40, whole-mm bores), so a built-in\nER chuck takes a collet and the collet takes a straight shank of its\nbore. The component stack group shows the resolver's gauge length,\ncutting diameter and corner radius for the shown stack, and a Swap\nmenu on each row offers only the parts with which the stack still\nresolves, landed as one SetToolAssembly. Tests click the Add\ncomponent combo box.\n\nRefs #3898\nRefs #3648\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
