        "date": "2026-11-27T08:18:11Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge #4271 (1534e5e09) into issue/3898-u7-followup\n\n#4271 now keeps the component caches in State (review of #4271). The\nconflicts:\n- stack.rs: the stack group reads the offer, the values and the swap\n  lists from State::component_stack_view (keyed on the table and stacks\n  read, the tool name, the tool record and the draft links). The values\n  and swap lists of this PR move into state_component_views.rs;\n  stack_view.rs and its thread-local cache are removed, so one cache\n  remains. The test reads the State counter.\n- tool_library_holders.rs: both module lines kept (builtin_collets of\n  this PR, lathe_stack from main); the doc comment names both.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
